   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{027E8A34C385A203}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "I. Situation:"
     m_sContent "<h2>I. Situation:</h2>"\
     "<b>Time & Weather:</b>"\
     "Time - Attackers Choose"\
     "Weather - Defenders Choose"\
     ""\
     "<b>Situation:</b>"\
     "Soviet VDV Company with Attached Mi-24s are conducting an air assault to secure the Bysovice Airfield from Canadian control, having already bypassed most of the forward emplaced defences. Canadians are just now aware of the threat and are preparing defences while QRFs are inbound, but unknown when or if they'll arrive."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{49A363EA22147F18}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "A. Enemy Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>A. Enemy Forces:</h2>"\
     "<b>Equipment:</b>"\
     "USSR are equipped with their standard WARSAW Pact weaponry, AK series, RPG7s, RPKs."\
     "Wearing the standard USSR uniform of VDV Camo with greenish helmet."\
     ""\
     "<b>Known Strength:</b>"\
     "1x VDV Company"\
     "2x Mi-24s"\
     "3x Mi-8s"\
     ""\
     "<b>Location: </b>"\
     "Last known location at 083 056"\
     ""\
     "<b>Capabilities:</b>"\
     "Access to RPKs, RPGs."\
     "Vehicles include Mi-8s & Mi-24s"\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCOA:</b>"\
     "Land and secure one of the infrastructures (Military Base, Industry, Hangers), before pushing outwards securing the rest."\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCOA:</b>"\
     "Land and secure one of the infrastructures (Military Base, Industry, Hangers), utilizing the Mi-24 to sweep the forests with rockets, before continuing to secure the rest of the Air field."\
     ""\
     "<b>Defensive Fires:</b>"\
     "No known threat at this time."\
     ""\
     "<b>Airthreat:</b>"\
     "Mi-24s and Mi-8s"\
     ""\
     "<b>Morale:</b>"\
     "VERY High."\
     ""\
     "<b>CBRN Threat:</b>"\
     "The enemy pose no CBRN Threat."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{32A090CBD70F5080}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "A. Enemy Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>A. Enemy Forces:</h2>"\
     "<b>Equipment:</b>"\
     "CAF are equipped with their standard NATO weaponry, M16A1s series, LAWs/M67s, M249s, M60, etc.."\
     "Wearing woodland coloured camo uniforms & helmets."\
     ""\
     "<b>Known Strength:</b>"\
     "1x Rifle Company (++)"\
     ""\
     "<b>Location:</b>"\
     "Throughout the Airfield, likely a Platoon (+) in each objective area if not more."\
     ""\
     "<b>Capabilities:</b>"\
     "No access to much AA or Heavy Weaponry until QRF arrive."\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCOA:</b>"\
     "Ambush us as we land on or around the Airfield, before pulling back."\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCOA:</b>"\
     "Ambush us as we land on or around the Airfield, before pulling back, utilizing their stingers to deny us our air superiority."\
     ""\
     "<b>Defensive Fires:</b>"\
     "No known threat at this time."\
     ""\
     "<b>Airthreat:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>Morale:</b>"\
     "High."\
     ""\
     "<b>CBRN Threat:</b>"\
     "The enemy pose no CBRN Threat."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3C8C8AA5DBB43620}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "B. Friendly Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>B. Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "<b>a. Disposition:</b>"\
     "Our Battalion (-) is located on the Airfield, we're fairly spread out and we don't know where all our fellow Platoons are located, but we have some clue."\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Higher Units Mission:</b>"\
     "Battalion has been assigned as security detail for the Air field while we prepare for the inevitable invasion."\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Composition:</b>"\
     "1x Platoon (-) (Players)"\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Strength:</b>"\
     "1st Platoon - At 6x Man Strength"\
     ""\
     "<b>e. Supporting Fires:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>f. Attachments/Detachments:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>g. Additional Ammunition</b>"\
     "FIM Stingers"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0644C1D4C08426E1}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "B. Friendly Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>B. Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "<b>a. Disposition:</b>"\
     "All VDV Forces (YOU) are located at 007 121"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Higher Units Mission:</b>"\
     "Company has been tasked with securing the Bysovice Airfield to allow Battalions to land shortly after our capture."\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Composition:</b>"\
     "1x VDV Company"\
     "1x Flight of Mi-24s"\
     "2x Flights of Mi-8s"\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Strength:</b>"\
     "340 - At 6x Man Strength."\
     "341 - At 17x Man Strength."\
     "344 - At 17x Man Strength."\
     "347 - At 17x Man Strength."\
     "Stavok - At 4x Man Strength"\
     "Zakuska- At 3x Man Strength"\
     ""\
     "<b>e. Supporting Fires:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>f. Attachments/Detachments:</b>"\
     "2x Mi-24s"\
     "-- 8x Infantry Capacity Per Mi-24"\
     "3x Mi-8s"\
     "-- 16x Infantry Capacity Per Mi-8s"\
     ""\
     "<b>g. Additional Ammunition</b>"\
     "None."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{2524A1E771B8BED8}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Prevent the loss of our critical Infrastructures.. if they are lost to the enemy we have no choice but to fall back."\
     ""\
     "15x Respawns at start and no more."\
     ""\
     "<b>We also have 4x FIM92 Stingers sitting in a Crate outside near the HMMWVs.. Recommend to focus them on the Mi-24s (Please do not use them against Mi-8 until all MI-24s are dead OR until they've at least completed their first landing. Mission Maker Intent</b>"\
     ""\
     "Adjacent Units (AI) will spawn upon the arrival of VDV Forces."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{6BAB171D4715DA93}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Secure the Bysovice Airfield by taking control over ONE of these infastructures - Military Base, Industrial or Hangers (Marked on map & Mission Notes)"\
     ""\
     "No Heavy weapons have been located at the Airfield nor any Stingers, at least until QRF Arrive. So we'd have a \"Easier\" time landing more in shock and awe on the airfield or close to the infrastructure than too far away."\
     ""\
     "Read Mission Notes for more details."\
     ""\
     "Vehicle Loading Plan (Recommended and Easy):"\
     "- 1st Platoon -> ZAKUSKA 1"\
     "- 2nd Platoon -> ZAKUSKA 2"\
     "- 3rd Platoon -> ZAKUSKA 3"\
     "- Company HQ -> Stavok 1 / 2"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{9ABBA0E0823AA309}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "Protect our South and North Infrastructures if they are lost to the enemy we have to fall back from the Airfield to Kamoryn."\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "Platoon Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to utilize our fellow comrades (AI) to locate the enemy and hit them before we have to pull back.. Also to shoot down the Mi-24s"\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "Platoon Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to not split up the squads too much or too far ahead so they can mutually support one another if needed."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7C91B2EECC115B3B}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "Air assault onto Airfield and secure the critical Infrastructures."\
     ""\
     "2x Mi-24s"\
     "-- 8x Infantry Capacity Per Mi-24"\
     "(10x Seats Total)"\
     ""\
     "3x Mi-8s"\
     "-- 17x Infantry Capacity per Mi-8s"\
     "(18x Seats Total)"\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to use the infantry to scout for any hard-to-attack locations and relay the information to the aircrafts which should only serve as direct fire support to the main VDV Element via the FASL"\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to air assault onto either ONE of the external HQ locations as a singular force to maintain force composition before moving onto the rest. Highly advised to NOT separate the company into independent Platoons."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{16EDD80D6A0C02B3}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "IV. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>IV: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Dress: Standard Canadian Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard Canadian Loadout"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
     "Replen Plan: None for 24h."\
     "Ammunition: Each man carries his own ammunition."\
     "IPE: Helmets and body armour are to be worn at all times."\
     ""\
     "Crate outside contains:"\
     "- 4x FIM92 Stingers"\
     "- 50x Flares Green"\
     "- 50x Flares Orange"\
     "- 50x Flares White"\
     ""\
     "Each HMMWV Contains:"\
     "300x Sandbags"\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Medical:</b>"\
     "Location: Company Aid Post is to be setup by platoon medic."\
     "CASEVAC: By foot or with Platoon Assets like HMMWVs"\
     "Plan: Set up a casualty collection point and extract casualties to this point."\
     "Stretchers: None"\
     "Med Packs: Platoon medpack carried by platoon medic."\
     "Morphine: Every soldier carries 1+ stick of morphine."\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Vehicles:</b>"\
     "2x HMMWV M2s"\
     "2x HMMWVs"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{21890FD0915478AC}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "IV. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>IV: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Dress: Standard Soviet Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard Soviet Loadout"\
     "Vehicle Loading:"\
     "- 1st Platoon -> ZAKUSKA 1"\
     "- 2nd Platoon -> ZAKUSKA 2"\
     "- 3rd Platoon -> ZAKUSKA 3"\
     "- Company HQ -> Stavok 1 / 2"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
